When \code{group} is active, p-value adjustment is applied independently
within each group. For global adjustment across all comparisons,
apply \code{\link[stats:p.adjust]{stats::p.adjust()}} to the result manually. Confidence intervals
reflect the specified \code{conf_level} and are not affected by p-value
adjustment.
